[chapter id="ch02-ringo" title="Chapter 2 - Shrine Morning (apple candy)"]
[bg file="bg/shrine.png"]
[ch file="ch/jolly.png" pos="left"]
[text]Next morning, hillside shrine. Snow-light, stone lanterns, quiet after the festival. Run run-2026-10-08T20-36-07-752Z-ringo.[/text]
[text speaker="Jolly"]I saved half the apple candy for this morning. Still shiny! Still a tiny lantern![/text]
[text speaker="Jolly"]Yesterday I chose the apple candy at the matsuri. Today the shrine path is covered in little pawprints - mine, from a sleepy midnight walk.[/text]
[bg file="bg/shrine.png"]
[text speaker="Jolly"]Should I make a wish at the shrine, or follow the pawprints to see where sleepy-me went?[/text]
[choose id="shrine-choice"]
[option id="wish" label="Clap twice and make a wish"]Make a wish.[/option]
[option id="prints" label="Follow the pawprints in the snow"]Follow the pawprints.[/option]
[/choose]
[label id="after-wish"]
[bg file="bg/rooftop.png"]
[text speaker="Jolly"]I wished for another festival... and for apple candy that never melts. Is that two wishes?[/text]
[text]The shrine bell rings once. From the hill, the whole town is visible, rooftops pink in the morning sun.[/text]
[text speaker="Jolly"]Okay. One wish was enough. The town looks like a story I get to keep reading.[/text]
[goto gen-end]
[label id="after-prints"]
[bg file="bg/shrine.png"]
[text speaker="Jolly"]These pawprints are exactly my size. Did I walk in a circle in my sleep?[/text]
[text]The pawprints loop around the stone lantern, pause at the offering box, and return to Jolly's feet. Sleepy-Jolly had an adventure too.[/text]
[text speaker="Jolly"]Mystery solved. Sleepy-me also wanted to see the lanterns. Fair enough.[/text]
[label id="gen-end"]
[bg file="bg/rooftop.png"]
[text speaker="Jolly"]Chapter 2 complete - apple-candy branch. Tomorrow, the rooftop at sunset? (The End - try the other Chapter 1 choice!)[/text]
[end]
